  "description": "The Brant Foundation and Brooklyn-based bicycle brand Affinity Cycles have partnered to release a custom Affinity x Keith Haring single-speed/fixed-gear bicycle, with a portion of proceeds from each purchase donated to Free Arts NYC.\nFree Arts NYC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit dedicated to providing free, high-quality arts programming for youth in underserved communities. Each purchase directly supports their mentorship and creative programs, helping young people build confidence, develop creativity, and gain the skills they need to succeed.\nThe Affinity x Keith Haring bicycle is a special collection inspired by the iconic work of Keith Haring. It is offered in two finishes: a matte black-and-white edition and a vibrant gloss edition featuring Haring’s colorful graphics.\nAvailable in five sizes (XS, S, M, L, XL) to suit riders from 5'4\" to 6'2\", each bicycle is hand-assembled in Brooklyn and available for local pickup or domestic and international shipping.\nMSRP: $3,499.99\nShipping additional where applicable.\nComes with an oversized (lined) rip stop tote bag, screen printed with all over graphics.\nKey Features:\n• 4130 custom drawn butted chromoly tubing\n• 1 1/8th fork & steerer tube (headset not included)\n• Fits 27.2 seat post (fits 29.8 or 30.0 clamp)\n• Available in 5 sizes",
